            largest_pair = entry;
        }
    }
    return largest_pair;
}
```

Explanation:

- Hum std::map aur std::pair use karne ke liye zaroori headers include karte hain.
- Hum largest_pair function define karte hain, jo input ke taur par std::map<int, int> ka constant reference leta hai aur std::pair<int, int> return karta hai.
